  "description_short": "Modern restobar in George East serving breakfast through cocktails with a relaxed, contemporary vibe.",
  "description_long": "Bru Restobar brings a fresh energy to George East's St Georges Square Centre, where the atmosphere shifts seamlessly from morning coffee spot to evening wine bar. The menu covers all bases—proper breakfasts to start your day, lighter café fare for lunch, and more substantial plates when you're settling in for sundowners.\n\nThe space strikes a balance between casual and polished, making it equally suited to a quick bite or a longer catch-up with mates. Their coffee programme takes itself seriously, while the bar selection shows thought beyond the usual suspects. It's become a reliable neighbourhood spot where locals pop in throughout the day.\n\nConveniently located in the George East shopping precinct with ample parking, Bru works whether you're after breakfast on the run, a midweek lunch, or Friday evening drinks. The consistent Google ratings reflect what regulars already know—it's simply a well-run establishment that delivers across the board.",
